      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>A species of rabbit that lives only in desert environments. No one knows why they live out there in the middle of a desert bu they always carry edible plants for them to consume. They may be docile, but they are very keen of enemies. Don't expect big rewards for butchering this sweet little bunny that attacks with sharp teeth!</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 18, touch 15, flat-footed 14 (+4 dex, +3 natural, +1 size)</p><p>hp 30 [48] (4d10+8)</p><p>mp 8</p><p>Fort +6, Ref +8, Will +4</p><p>Weakness Water</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 50 ft.</p><p>Melee Bite +7 (1d6+2)</p><p>Special Attacks Carrot</p><p>Spells Known (FC CL 4th, Concentration +7)</p><p>1st (DC 14) - cure</p><p>2nd (DC 15) - cure II</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 14, Dex 18, Con 14, Int 3, Wis 16, Cha 5</p><p>Base Atk +4; CMB +5; CMD 19</p><p>Feats Improved Initiative, Run</p><p>Skills Acrobatics +4 (Jumping +12), Stealth +17; Racial Modifiers +8 Jumping;</p><p>SQ Large Teeth, Last Wish</p>"
      }
